        <mxCell id="box_rules" value="&lt;b&gt;DECOMPOSITION &amp;amp; BALANCING VERIFICATION RULES (RULE_DFD.MD):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Rules 2 &amp;amp; 3 (Process &amp;amp; DB Separation):&lt;/b&gt; The system is decomposed into 6 independent business processes communicating via 4 physical database data stores.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Rule 4 (Data Flow Splitting):&lt;/b&gt; Flow &lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;Map &amp;amp; POI Management Data&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt; splits into &lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;Area Map Info&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt; (to 2.0) and &lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;Point of Interest Info&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt; (to 3.0).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Rule 5 (Data Transformation):&lt;/b&gt; Flow &lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;Position Coordinates &amp;amp; Language&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt; is processed by 6.0 (Euclidean geofence check) into &lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;Narration Audio &amp;amp; Subtitles&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt; for Visitors and &lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;Online Visitor Radar Data&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt; for Admin.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. External Entity Preservation:&lt;/b&gt; EXACTLY 2 external entities: Administrator and Visitor.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. I/O Flow Limit:&lt;/b&gt; Every process has 1 to 3 input groups and 1 to 3 output groups.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6. Data Store Alignment:&lt;/b&gt; 4 data stores map 1-to-1 to the 4 physical SQL Server tables (D1: TaiKhoanAdmin, D2: BanDoKhuVuc, D3: DiaDiemThamQuan, D4: NoiDungThuyetMinh)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#F9FAFB;strokeColor=#D1D5DB;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#374151;" vertex="1" parent="1">
